{"id":"637818","name":"红椒拌茄子","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/637818/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红椒","amount":"1个"},{"name":"茄子","amount":"3根"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"芝麻油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：红椒、茄子。","img":"images/637818/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将红椒去蒂去籽，茄子去蒂两者一道清洗清洗捞出。","img":"images/637818/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"茄子折段和红椒一道放入蒸锅里。","img":"images/637818/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"盖上盖，隔水蒸7——8分钟。","img":"images/637818/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"接着，开盖取出。","img":"images/637818/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"晾凉。","img":"images/637818/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"然后，将晾凉好的茄子和红椒撕开。","img":"images/637818/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"最后，加适量的盐。","img":"images/637818/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加适量的味精。","img":"images/637818/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加适量的生抽。","img":"images/637818/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加适量的芝麻油。","img":"images/637818/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"调味拌匀即成。","img":"images/637818/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}